@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765
@projectId = replace-with-project-id
@assetId = replace-with-confirmed-source-asset-id

### Opens a Windows OS folder dialog; Cancel returns {"path":null}.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dialogs/folder
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"initial_path":"C:\\Work\\HubRadio\\OpeningClosing"}

### Requires source rights confirmation and no existing card images.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scene-cards
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_id":"{{assetId}}","count":4}

### From a registered opening / closing video (must be a file of the registered brand kit; anything else is 404).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scene-cards
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"brand_path":"C:\\Work\\HubRadio\\OpeningClosing\\Opening-9x16.mp4","count":3}

### 作らない: keep existing images but stop using them in new candidates (make=true to use them again).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scene-cards/settings
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"make":false}

### Preview the first extracted PNG.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scene-cards/0

### Validation error: count must be 2–6.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scene-cards
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"asset_id":"{{assetId}}","count":7}
